                                                "sense_id": "4a04c2b4-8399-33c6-8dfe-6d6ff009907e",
                                                "text": "Those half-rounding guards / Just met, and, closing, stood in squadron joined."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db579485-b692-34b3-a59d-a7501df5bfd4",
